 n Vermont at the Best of Vermont Summer Festival\, presented by Mary W. Da
 vis Realtor & Associates. Enjoy live music\, craft beverage producers\, ch
 eese and maple makers\, specialty foods\, artisan products\, fine art\, an
 d a fun kids zone. The festival welcomes locals\, new residents\, second-h
 ome owners\, and visitors alike.\nSource: Vermont Journal & Shopper
