 rers or intermediates involved! Because of this\, you can ask any and all 
 questions about how the products you buy got to the market and into your h
 ands. We value vendor/customer relationships and offer pre-ordering/pi\nSo
 urce: GNAT-TV Regional Calendar (mountain towns)
